  "saySample": [
   {
    "day": 1,
    "text": "You push through the doors into open air. Haven grounds — tents, a fire pit, worn paths. The world is that way."
   },
   {
    "day": 1,
    "text": "You break ground behind the hall — bed 1 of 2, turned and ready. Sow seed to start a crop."
   },
   {
    "day": 1,
    "text": "You break ground behind the hall — bed 2 of 2, turned and ready. Sow seed to start a crop."
   },
   {
    "day": 1,
    "text": "💧 A woman, maybe 30s returns with water: +3 clean."
   },
   {
    "day": 1,
    "text": "💧 A man, maybe 50s returns with water: +4 clean."
   },
   {
    "day": 1,
    "text": "\"Hey.\" A person, maybe 60s, with calloused knuckles settles near you, not too close. \"Day one. Everyone's pretending they're fine. ...Can we talk? Just talk — like people used to.\" (Talk to A person, maybe 60s, with calloused knuckles.)"
   },
   {
    "day": 1,
    "text": "Recipe: Bark armor (Level 1). You have seen bark armor. Plates of bark laced together, worn like a shell."
   },
   {
    "day": 1,
    "text": "🛡️ Dawn at Haven. By the fire hangs an old bark cuirass, split at the seam — somebody's grandfather wore this into the treeline and came back. The shape of it is clear: bark plates laced overlapping like shingles, vine cord. Your hands don't know it yet. Your eyes do."
   },
   {
    "day": 1,
    "text": "⚠ STARVING: health and energy falling. You went to bed on an empty stomach."
   },
   {
    "day": 1,
    "text": "Village meal: +1200 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"
   },
   {
    "day": 1,
    "text": "A person, maybe 60s, with calloused knuckles is humming something. It stops when they notice you listening."
   },
   {
    "day": 1,
    "text": "A woman, maybe 60s is hurt — a fall, a thorn, a bad step. (health 74/100)"
   },
   {
    "day": 1,
    "text": "Brunhilde and Landon lingered over the fire together."
   },
   {
    "day": 1,
    "text": "Daniela and Brunhilde lingered over the fire together."
   },
   {
    "day": 1,
    "text": "Tesfaye and Brunhilde lingered over the fire together."
   },
   {
    "day": 1,
    "text": "Brian and Brunhilde lingered over the fire together."
   },
   {
    "day": 1,
    "text": "Jorge and Brunhilde lingered over the fire together."
   },
   {
    "day": 1,
    "text": "📓 Journal: the person in their 60s, with a burn-scarred forearm taught the person in their 60s, with calloused knuckles Food Preservation."
   },
   {
    "day": 2,
    "text": "— DAY 2 DAWN — The world wakes. Animals are active."
   },
   {
    "day": 2,
    "text": "👀 the person in their 60s, with calloused knuckles let a place-name slip — somewhere that isn't Denver — then covered it with \"Denver\" so fast the cover was louder than the slip."
   },
   {
    "day": 2,
    "text": "📓 Journal: jotted down what they said (A person, maybe 60s, with calloused knuckles)."
   },
   {
    "day": 2,
    "text": "👀 the man in his 20s, the glazier starts a story with \"back when I was a glazier...\" then corrects to something else mid-sentence. The correction is worse than the slip."
   },
   {
    "day": 2,
    "text": "📓 Journal: jotted down what they said (A man, maybe 20s)."
   },
   {
    "day": 2,
    "text": "Landon Hayes reads the sky: rain tomorrow, cold."
   },
   {
    "day": 2,
    "text": "A person, maybe 60s, with a burn-scarred forearm will work the garden once each day while at Haven. Other orders take priority."
   },
   {
    "day": 2,
    "text": "You step into the Haven hall."
   },
   {
    "day": 2,
    "text": "\"You haven't earned that yet,\" A person, maybe 60s, with a burn-scarred forearm says. (Trust too low.)"
   },
   {
    "day": 2,
    "text": "\"You haven't earned that yet,\" A person, maybe 40s says. (Trust too low.)"
   },
   {
    "day": 2,
    "text": "📋 A person, maybe 60s, with sun-creased eyes — 🎣 Fish. They'll report back by next part."
   },
   {
    "day": 2,
    "text": "\"Got it,\" A person, maybe 60s, with a burn-scarred forearm says flatly. \"Orders are orders. Whoever gives them.\""
   },
   {
    "day": 2,
    "text": "\"You haven't earned that yet,\" A person, maybe 60s, with a burn-scarred forearm says. (Trust too low.)"
   },
   {
    "day": 2,
    "text": "\"You haven't earned that yet,\" A person, maybe 40s says. (Trust too low.)"
   },
   {
    "day": 2,
    "text": "📋 A person, maybe 60s, with calloused knuckles — 🎣 Fish. They'll report back by next part."
   },
   {
    "day": 2,
    "text": "A person, maybe 60s, with a burn-scarred forearm doesn't say a word. They just stand there, arms crossed, until you finish giving the order. The silence does the talking."
   },
   {
    "day": 2,
    "text": "(Talking costs a little energy — 10 kcal a conversation. Small talk is cheap; going deep costs time, not more food.)"
   },
   {
    "day": 2,
    "text": "Hunger gnaws. The pack is thin — work the green, haul it back, get it named at camp. That's the whole game."
   },
   {
    "day": 2,
    "text": "...and then it lands: A woman, maybe 30s speaks 🇺🇸 English. A few shared words. Gestures. Patience."
   },
   {
    "day": 2,
    "text": "\"Sigrid,\" they say, touching their chest. \"I'm Sigrid.\" You'll remember that."
   },
   {
    "day": 2,
    "text": "📓 Journal: learned their name (Sigrid)."
   },
   {
    "day": 2,
    "text": "\"Grace,\" they say, touching their chest. \"I'm Grace.\" You'll remember that."
   },
   {
    "day": 2,
    "text": "📓 Journal: learned their name (Grace)."
   },
