    "text": "\"Tesfaye,\" they say, touching their chest. \"I'm Tesfaye.\" You'll remember that."
   },
   {
    "day": 2,
    "text": "📓 Journal: learned their name (Tesfaye)."
   },
   {
    "day": 2,
    "text": "You eat Dried meat and Trail mix (1400 kcal)."
   },
   {
    "day": 2,
    "text": "It's barely dawn. The day is yours — sleep is for later."
